cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si vous utilisez ces données, citez la source comme ci-dessous (le crédit propre à chaque jeu est dans son dossier). If you use these data, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Train Nomade : données ouvertes ferroviaires (France)"
abstract: >-
  Open datasets about trains in France: service at every railway station, railway geometry between two stops,
  night trains, connections between stations and local public transport. Computed by Train Nomade from official
  open data (SNCF Voyageurs GTFS timetables, local transport networks, OpenStreetMap). Live files:
  https://api.trainnomade.fr/donnees/v1/
authors:
  - name: "Train Nomade"
    email: contact@trainnomade.fr
    website: "https://trainnomade.fr"
license: ODbL-1.0
url: "https://trainnomade.fr"
repository: "https://github.com/trainnomade/donnees-ouvertes"
keywords:
  - railway
  - train
  - station
  - SNCF
  - GTFS
  - France
  - open data
